\**{c=red:Note for Windower users:}** The last cutscene will most likely freeze. This happens even at the default framerate. If this happens, the Mission will still be flagged as completed, and you can continue to the next Mission after disconnecting and logging in again.
If you wish to watch the cutscene, disconnect from the game and log in without Windower.
=2 Walkthrough
* Click the **Ensorcelled Door** at (B-10) south-west corner in {z:Ro'Maeve}.
** There is no cutscene, but you will be told about a "hexagonal depression" on the door.
* You must collect 6 {@k} Key Item fragments from various monsters.
** **{c=red:Note:}** If you are in a party/alliance, **everyone** in the group will obtain the {@k} Key Item if it drops.
** The fragments are not a guaranteed drop, but have a high drop rate. {p:Treasure Hunter} does not work on them, because they are not normal items.
** The NMs will despawn 5 minutes after being engaged and will respawn 2 minutes after either despawning or successfully being killed.
* If relying on damage from {p:Trusts|Trust}, refer to the {p:Damage Type} table to select the appropriate Trust for each NM.

=4 Fragments
* {@k} {k:Luminous blue fragment} from {m:Lode Golem} at (E-9/10) in {z:Ro'Maeve}.
** Only takes {@a:Magic|Detects by Magic} Magic damage from Darkness elemental ({@g:Element: Ice|Ice} {p:Ice} {@g:Element: Water|Water} {p:Water}, {@g:Element: Earth|Earth} {p:Earth}, and {@g:Element: Dark|Darkness} {p:Dark}) spells.
** {p:Quick Draw} also works.
* {@k} {k:Luminous purple fragment} from {m:Fired Urn} at (K-9/10) in {z:Ro'Maeve}.
** Only takes {@g:Slashing|Slashing} Slashing damage.
* {@k} {k:Luminous yellow fragment} from {m:Steely Weapon} at (G-10/11) in {z:Ro'Maeve}.
** Only takes damage from {@g:Ranged|Ranged} Ranged weapons.
** Ninja's {p:Daken} Job Trait does not work.

\**Note:** The NMs in {z:The Sanctuary of Zi'Tah} only appear between the hours of 17:00 and 7:00 {p:Vana'diel Time}.
* {@k} {k:Luminous green fragment} from {m:Holey Horror} at (H-8) in {z:The Sanctuary of Zi'Tah}.
** Only takes {@g:Piercing|Piercing} Piercing damage (not {@g:Ranged|Ranged} Ranged damage.)
** Ninja's {p:Daken} Job Trait does work.
* {@k} {k:Luminous red fragment} from {m:Skeleton Scuffler} at (F-8) in {z:The Sanctuary of Zi'Tah}.
** Only takes {@g:Blunt|Blunt} Blunt damage
** {p:Quick Draw} can also damage it, but its damage is severely reduced.
* {@k} {k:Luminous beige fragment} from {m:Blest Bones} at (F-7) in {z:The Sanctuary of Zi'Tah}.
** Only takes {@a:Magic|Detects by Magic} Magic damage from Light elemental ({@g:Element: Thunder|Thunder} {s:Thunder}, {@g:Element: Fire|Fire} {p:Fire}, {@g:Element: Wind|Wind} {p:Wind}, and {@g:Element: Light|Light} {p:Light}) spells.
** {p:Quick Draw} also works.

Once all the fragments are obtained, return to the **Ensorcelled Door** at (B-10) for a cutscene.
* This is the cutscene that will break for Windower users.

